      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "The difference in metadata like `general.architecture` and `general.name` is due to different versions of the `gguf` library. We used a customized internal version of the library to produce the official file, and these naming changes haven't been synced to the public PyPI release yet.\n\nThese are purely metadata differences and have **no impact on the model's weights or inference performance**. Your converted model will work correctly.",
